(F5 T2 V4c: element_beam_force_moment (manual Professional 6.416) and
 element_beam_direction_z (6.415) in 2D. Dedicated analytic test (the
 Professional 02-08-2026 2D beam stops with a singular pardiso matrix on
 these inputs, so no Professional reference). Three cantilevers of
 length 1 along x, E 2, Iyy 1, Izz 4, tip force P 0.01 in y, tip velx
 fixed. Element 1: no record (classic GNU 2D beam, local z = global z):
 vely P/(3 E Izz) 4.166666667e-4, rotz P/(2 E Izz) 6.25e-4,
 element_beam_force_moment 0 -0.01 0 0 0 -0.01 0 0.01 0 0 0 0.
 Element 2: element_beam_direction_z 0 0 -1 (local y = -global y): same
 displacements, element_beam_force_moment 0 0.01 0 0 0 0.01 0 -0.01 0 0
 0 0. Element 3: element_beam_direction_z 0 1 0 (local z = global y,
 bending with Iyy): vely P/(3 E Iyy) 1.666666667e-3, rotz 2.5e-3,
 element_beam_force_moment 0 0 -0.01 0 0.01 0 0 0 0.01 0 0 0.
 group_beam_memory -total_linear (the Professional default beam memory;
 the GNU default -updated rotates the beam chord: BEAM-MEMORY-DEFAULT).)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
beam_rotation
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 0 2
node 4 1 2
node 5 0 4
node 6 1 4
element 1 -beam 1 2
element 2 -beam 3 4
element 3 -beam 5 6
element_beam_direction_z 2 0 0 -1
element_beam_direction_z 3 0 1 0
group_type 0 -beam
group_beam_young 0 2
group_beam_shear 0 0.5
group_beam_inertia 0 1 4 3
group_beam_memory 0 -total_linear
bounda_dof 0 -ra 1 3 5 -ra -velx -vely -rotz
bounda_dof 2 -ra 2 4 6 -ra -velx
bounda_force 1 -ra 2 4 6 -ra -vely
bounda_time 1 0.01
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
